Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030,0035)}{\frz1.378\pos(544,460)}A{\fntangak}lchemistry
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.56,1:18:59.64,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(118,118)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, Tommo, Zero Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.53,0:00:45.95,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,We are hiring servants in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:47.49,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.75,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:52.83,general text,,0,0,0,,If it conveys your feelings, this is a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:00.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I probably looked pathetic in my attempts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:02.38,general text,,0,0,0,,get here as a servant
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:06.35,general text,,0,0,0,,You were an incredibly experienced teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:08.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:11.60,general text,,0,0,0,,At least you learned loyalty\N and fulfill your duties
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:13.85,general text,,0,0,0,,My teacher tried so hard for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:17.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought I should give it my all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:20.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Did this stress you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:23.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Not really. But I doubted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:29.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Answer you as a student or as a master
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:32.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Or answer in the style of what you read
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:35.33,general text,,0,0,0,,And what did you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:39.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Then answer the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:43.01,general text,,0,0,0,,The same? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:45.26,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s written right there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.76,general text,,0,0,0,,"I'll go through everything just to see you"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:51.64,general text,,0,0,0,,"I can do anything, just to have the opportunity to see you"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:53.81,general text,,0,0,0,,And this is my answer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.11,0:02:06.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I missed you too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.45,0:02:11.79,general text,,0,0,0,,This is my answer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll pretend I didn’t hear this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.28,general text,,0,0,0,,And forget about the letter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.45,0:02:51.95,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t get rid of something,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:54.50,general text,,0,0,0,,if already shared with someone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You can get rid of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Can be burned,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.67,general text,,0,0,0,,as if it never happened
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You think you’ll burn it and the letter didn’t exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:11.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Only now, teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.47,general text,,0,0,0,,your student
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.77,general text,,0,0,0,,learned to see what cannot be seen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:22.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I read “Words of the Heart.” Do you want to check?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:26.32,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to concentrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:29.32,general text,,0,0,0,,to read what you can’t see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:31.82,general text,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.33,general text,,0,0,0,,say the addressee’s name
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:44.67,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Clear but dangerous signal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:48.30,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:52.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, there you go. I read
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Something is hard to read because it is hidden,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.06,general text,,0,0,0,,but it is there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:06.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You saw the mark in my eyes, you learned that I am a nomad,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:09.36,general text,,0,0,0,,that caught me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:13.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I saw my other weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:15.12,general text,,0,0,0,,If this is your weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:17.33,general text,,0,0,0,,then mine too
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.37,0:04:21.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Your letter is my answer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.46,general text,,0,0,0,,So we have one weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:28.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I think I don’t mind sharing your weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:33.18,general text,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was worried
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You finally found what you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.51,0:04:40.68,general text,,0,0,0,,And I couldn’t do anything even if you left me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:44.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I even thought about poisoning you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:46.77,general text,,0,0,0,,and find something to denigrate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:53.28,general text,,0,0,0,,apparently you are already poisoned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:55.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:58.20,general text,,0,0,0,,You will become weak and infirm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.25,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no escape from this poison
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.33,general text,,0,0,0,,The antidote is the person who poisoned you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:07.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So, I missed you because,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:09.55,general text,,0,0,0,,what was poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:14.64,general text,,0,0,0,,You were mercilessly poisoned by a shadow warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:16.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Think in this way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.35,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not far from the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.06,general text,,0,0,0,,So it’s poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:26.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, it was strange that among everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:28.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I missed you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:32.28,general text,,0,0,0,,You were always threatening to kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:34.15,general text,,0,0,0,,She even threw a knife at me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:36.62,general text,,0,0,0,,She laughed at me, I almost lost my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.41,general text,,0,0,0,,And you have the nerve to lie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You were cruel to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:43.00,general text,,0,0,0,,but I couldn’t help but think about you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:44.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Open my eyes - I already miss you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:48.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I miss you all day, even when I go to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:50.00,general text,,0,0,0,,- Stop\N- Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:52.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I confessed my feelings, and you compared them to poison
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:55.43,general text,,0,0,0,,So at least listen to what my symptoms are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:57.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You are my antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:02.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I just said that I missed you, you terrible shadow warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:04.56,general text,,0,0,0,,And you say I’m poisoned
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:07.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Now bear with my complaints about symptoms
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:08.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I was poisoned, after all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:11.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to be ashamed of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:13.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Since you are an antidote, that means you are related to poisoning
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:30.25,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the nephew of the head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.55,general text,,0,0,0,,and our next chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:41.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to greet you on behalf of the head
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.51,0:06:44.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on joining Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:46.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Well done
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:52.36,general text,,0,0,0,,You did a good job today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:56.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Today you will be offered booze and meat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:58.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You can have some fun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:02.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Go, eat, drink
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:05.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:09.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:12.34,general text,,0,0,0,,are you familiar with Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.25,general text,,0,0,0,,She passed the exam today
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:18.26,general text,,0,0,0,,The servant who came last
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:23.01,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,One hundred twenty-five
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:40.78,memories,,0,0,0,,Number 125, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.53,memories,,0,0,0,,Passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I know Mu Dok well
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:59.34,general text,,0,0,0,,She lost consciousness and was taken to Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:01.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to return her things
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:06.85,general text,,0,0,0,,and give the amulet to enter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.43,0:08:09.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she still in Saejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Give it to me. I'll pass it on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You did a good job today
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:22.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:48.18,memories,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:11.96,memories,,0,0,0,,You are lost because in your head
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:14.46,memories,,0,0,0,,too many thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:18.17,memories,,0,0,0,,When this happens, think about one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:23.68,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Nak Soo, the only one you think about is Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:40.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Listen, Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:43.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I accidentally looked into Moo Deok's bag
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:48.20,general text,,0,0,0,,and found something strange
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:52.75,general text,,0,0,0,,This is your whistle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:55.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Which you lost in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, mine
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:01.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Then why does Moo Dok have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Mr. Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:19.23,general text,,0,0,0,,He has my things and an amulet for entry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:25.32,general text,,0,0,0,,He gave them to me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:26.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:28.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:41.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I lost him in Danhyangok. Did you find him there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:49.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I took it because...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:54.47,general text,,0,0,0,,In love with me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.77,general text,,0,0,0,,You said so yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:03.48,general text,,0,0,0,,This explanation is enough
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.87,0:11:11.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take my things,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:13.54,general text,,0,0,0,,and you take the whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:21.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I told Dan Gu that I gave it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:23.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Can’t take it back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:28.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you giving it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.93,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t believe it when I confessed my love
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:34.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you had to make me believe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:46.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I was just making fun of them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:49.61,general text,,0,0,0,,And Moo Dok really loves Yulia
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:52.20,general text,,0,0,0,,And considering Julia’s gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:54.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I think he’s also breathing unevenly towards her
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:57.83,general text,,0,0,0,,She probably asked for this whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:11:59.92,general text,,0,0,0,,When she needs something,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:02.00,general text,,0,0,0,,she lies and dodges easily
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:06.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul even knew about her participation in the exam
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:09.30,general text,,0,0,0,,He answered all the questions for her sake
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:12.43,general text,,0,0,0,,She definitely asked him to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:14.68,general text,,0,0,0,,because I’m too stupid myself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.89,0:12:17.43,general text,,0,0,0,,She always gets what she wants
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:19.81,general text,,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:24.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw them walking together nicely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:26.15,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.15,0:12:28.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:38.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Deok and Yul met once
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:42.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you didn’t know because you were locked in the training room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:43.58,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I didn’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.74,general text,,0,0,0,,What if this is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:19.45,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I missed you too
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:20.66,memories,,0,0,0,,This is my answer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:33.34,general text,,0,0,0,,She refused because she doesn’t like me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:36.18,general text,,0,0,0,,She didn’t miss her like I did
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:40.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Only I missed you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:50.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to drink poison and die
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.41,0:13:59.70,general text,,0,0,0,,What a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:13.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I like you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:17.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you about this hundreds of times
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:25.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know much about love,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:30.02,general text,,0,0,0,,but when you like someone, you don't repeat it over and over again
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:34.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Because it’s difficult to admit even once
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:41.08,general text,,0,0,0,,This whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:46.04,general text,,0,0,0,,belonged to a friend to whom I could never confess
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:56.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I really like you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.31,0:15:08.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to tell her about this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:15.69,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I want to try it too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:18.45,memories,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:59.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You have now entered Sosnovy Bor. We will see each other more often
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:04.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You can come to me if you need anything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:11.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:42.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook read “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.03,general text,,0,0,0,,You helped him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:49.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I found out that he could, so I came to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:54.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell Jin to deliver this book to Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:57.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Bone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:58.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:02.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook was angry that everyone was reading this “letter”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:06.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I think Master Seo Kyung would feel the same
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:10.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently you really like Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:14.81,general text,,0,0,0,,He's special, that's why I watch him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:16.86,general text,,0,0,0,,He is very smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:20.36,general text,,0,0,0,,but Jin wants to lock him here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:24.99,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:27.78,memories,,0,0,0,,that the ice stone is not in Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:32.66,memories,,0,0,0,,20 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:36.04,memories,,0,0,0,,gwangju Chang Gang mastered the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.30,memories,,0,0,0,,Because of this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:42.01,memories,,0,0,0,,a child was born who should not have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:46.47,memories,,0,0,0,,And that night the King’s star shone in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.26,memories,,0,0,0,,Is this Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.22,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:55.69,memories,,0,0,0,,The magician unsealed the stone in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:59.61,memories,,0,0,0,,and through the alchemy of souls the king's son was born
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:05.82,memories,,0,0,0,,Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan knows about this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:11.16,memories,,0,0,0,,If they already have the stone, what excuse can there be
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:14.04,memories,,0,0,0,,invent Pine Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:17.83,memories,,0,0,0,,to take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:27.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin has no other way to protect Pine Forest except to hide Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:28.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:32.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there something I don’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:47.45,general text,,0,0,0,,How can you even trust such a careless and imprudent youth with secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.58,general text,,0,0,0,,How could you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope it washes off
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:58.42,general text,,0,0,0,,He's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:00.79,general text,,0,0,0,,didn’t get angry, even when I said there was more
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t drink chastity tea
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:08.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait, the scarf is a gift from the maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:32.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Cleaning must be completed before
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.62,general text,,0,0,0,,how the magicians will begin their classes. Faster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:35.54,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:57.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:20:00.06,general text,,0,0,0,,- He won’t come?\N- Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:01.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I went to wake him up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:03.73,general text,,0,0,0,,but he said that he didn’t sleep a wink last night
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:06.07,general text,,0,0,0,,And he’s going to skip? On the first day?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.15,general text,,0,0,0,,See you, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:29.55,general text,,0,0,0,,We have to get up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:32.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:37.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I'll hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:51.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t make noise and go, I’ll sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:56.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? Did you want death?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:01.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m crazy and I want to die
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:03.75,general text,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:06.38,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the symptoms of my poisoning
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:10.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, stop being stubborn and angry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I said that I am the antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:17.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.14,0:21:20.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Here I am
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:32.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:48.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:52.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you read “Words of the Heart.” I'm surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:53.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing to be surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:56.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I see you are reading about the Hyonggon technique
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I mastered this style of swordsmanship as a child
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:02.02,general text,,0,0,0,,If you teach to read “Words of the Heart”,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:03.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I will help you master Hyonggon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.52,0:22:07.36,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to think
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:12.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Agree. Say you agree
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:16.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Listen, I’m tired of something
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.45,0:22:20.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Ask Master Li for help
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.34,0:22:30.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.09,0:22:33.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I mastered Ryusu in about the same time as you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.17,0:22:37.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.13,0:22:39.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will lend you the sapphire carpet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.51,0:22:41.47,general text,,0,0,0,,for training
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:45.23,general text,,0,0,0,,With its help, energy can be doubled
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:48.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Sapphire carpet? This is such a rarity
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.02,0:22:51.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, this is a good opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:56.57,general text,,0,0,0,,But such a carpet is cold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.36,0:22:59.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I get sick quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:02.41,general text,,0,0,0,,So I don’t need this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.54,0:23:11.84,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.21,0:23:16.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I haven't slept well these days, I'm going to take a nap
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.59,0:23:21.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Missed the chance to master Hyonggon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:22.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you completely crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.89,0:23:25.64,general text,,0,0,0,,And yesterday. The sapphire carpet is hard to come by,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.73,0:23:27.14,general text,,0,0,0,,and you said he was cold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.23,0:23:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I had to agree even if I could die on it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Incredible. "Crazy. Die"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.57,0:23:34.40,general text,,0,0,0,,That's all you tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:37.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Give it here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.83,0:23:48.75,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.83,0:23:50.37,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t fit here together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.29,0:23:53.13,general text,,0,0,0,,You will only go to bed if I get up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:57.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Get up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.05,0:24:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,And you make
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:03.18,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t be difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:19.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I said I missed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.15,0:24:22.74,general text,,0,0,0,,and you said I’m poisoned, so I need to sleep and come to my senses
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.82,0:24:24.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop messing with me, at least for a little while
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.95,0:24:31.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You just want to upset me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:35.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you, if I die, you will die too
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.88,0:24:38.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm in agony, you should feel at least something too
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.71,0:24:41.88,general text,,0,0,0,,When I sleep, I even have cramps
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.35,0:24:49.81,general text,,0,0,0,,And for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.02,0:24:51.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.48,0:24:54.11,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Upsetting?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.73,0:24:56.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Then help me make myself more comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.62,0:25:09.54,general text,,0,0,0,,The owner is constantly sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.62,0:25:12.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell him to train
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.16,0:25:14.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Mages of Jeonjingak train at will
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.13,0:25:17.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Each person masters his energy differently
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.29,0:25:19.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I won't interfere as long as he doesn't break the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.09,0:25:22.01,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.09,0:25:24.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Here he is
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.47,0:25:33.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I have a headache,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.23,0:25:34.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go home
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.60,0:25:37.11,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’ll come to my senses, soaking in the water
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:41.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Does your head hurt? You didn't do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.24,0:25:45.24,general text,,0,0,0,,And you can’t go home. It's not according to the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.32,0:25:46.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.49,0:25:49.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook exception. He has the head's permission
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:50.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.79,0:25:53.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Busy with all sorts of entertainment, you had no time for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.87,0:25:56.79,general text,,0,0,0,,but I made a deal with the head while I was locked here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.59,0:26:00.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.05,0:26:06.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go with him
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.05,0:26:09.97,general text,,0,0,0,,If you go, you will be kicked out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.06,0:26:13.35,general text,,0,0,0,,You tried so hard to get here. Are you ready to just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:26.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook went home
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.16,0:26:27.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.74,0:26:31.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him go wherever he wants
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.79,0:26:34.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Then he will become lazy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.12,0:26:36.00,italics,,0,0,0,,Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.96,0:26:42.46,general text,,0,0,0,,The lady asks you to wait a little
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.30,0:26:46.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she hosting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.39,0:26:55.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw Jeonbugwan's servant on the way here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.23,0:26:58.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe Deputy Jin Mu is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.40,0:27:02.98,general text,,0,0,0,,They are not close enough to see each other like that
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.15,0:27:07.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Just in case, go and check who’s leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.83,0:27:20.46,general text,,0,0,0,,If Master Li wants it that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.54,0:27:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,we will hide “Words of the Heart” in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:28.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you see anyone else today?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:30.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Distant relative
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.81,0:27:37.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Cho Young will inherit Jinyoung?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.06,0:27:40.52,general text,,0,0,0,,This has not been decided yet
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.40,0:27:43.82,general text,,0,0,0,,My eldest daughter may still be alive
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.03,0:27:48.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Ten years have passed since then
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.45,0:27:51.37,general text,,0,0,0,,And although she is blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.45,0:27:55.41,general text,,0,0,0,,she could sense energy and control relics like no one else
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.49,0:27:57.20,general text,,0,0,0,,It was a very smart child
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.29,0:27:58.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Unlike other children,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.62,0:28:02.92,general text,,0,0,0,,she was born at 13 months
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.46,0:28:07.92,general text,,0,0,0,,She was born on the day that Chang Gang named Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.01,0:28:09.47,general text,,0,0,0,,blessed by heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.72,0:28:15.47,general text,,0,0,0,,She was born on the day Chang Gang chose for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.93,0:28:18.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it possible
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.18,0:28:22.23,general text,,0,0,0,,select the date and time of birth of the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:24.90,general text,,0,0,0,,It was a coincidence
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.57,0:28:29.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I would like to invite Master Lee to Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.49,0:28:31.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell him this
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.03,0:28:34.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.88,0:28:51.93,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I carried her for 13 months
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.01,0:28:55.05,memories,,0,0,0,,I can’t let her go so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.68,0:28:58.56,memories,,0,0,0,,I heard the stone has power
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:29:01.56,memories,,0,0,0,,bring dead souls back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.19,0:29:09.32,memories,,0,0,0,,Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.36,0:29:12.57,memories,,0,0,0,,Help me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.87,0:29:27.50,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I came this far to protect my child
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.85,0:29:40.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.52,0:29:44.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:47.86,general text,,0,0,0,,to find you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.79,0:30:02.83,general text,,0,0,0,,- Did you check who this important guest was?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.37,0:30:07.84,italics,,0,0,0,,It was Deputy Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.17,0:30:12.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Since when is the head of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.38,0:30:15.63,general text,,0,0,0,,considers him a member of the family and accepts him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:17.55,general text,,0,0,0,,He quietly left through the back gate
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.30,0:30:21.02,general text,,0,0,0,,So the meeting was secret
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.18,0:30:24.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder what tricks he used
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.98,0:30:27.94,general text,,0,0,0,,slippery Jin Mu to freely visit Jinyoewon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.29,0:30:48.67,italics,,0,0,0,,You are blind, so you don’t know where you are
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.79,0:30:52.80,italics,,0,0,0,,You will be silent and do what they ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.38,0:30:54.92,italics,,0,0,0,,save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.55,0:30:57.38,italics,,0,0,0,,No sound
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.47,0:30:58.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Get up
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:20.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.31,0:32:30.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Leave her, the rest can go
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.48,0:32:36.73,offscreen,,0,0,0,,They are looking for the girl from the portrait
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.82,0:32:38.32,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Apparently she is blind
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.36,0:32:42.32,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He said the others could go, why no sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.89,0:33:13.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You can see
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.98,0:33:18.90,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity. I thought I found the right girl
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.44,0:33:20.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Kill her
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:25.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:31.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I could be the girl from the portrait
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.29,0:33:38.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Spare me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.21,0:33:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You said I’m coming
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.09,0:33:43.97,general text,,0,0,0,,If you have to be blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.10,0:33:49.18,general text,,0,0,0,,then I will be one
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.78,0:34:06.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Entertaining girl. Get up
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.91,0:34:15.08,general text,,0,0,0,,So you can pretend to be blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.92,0:34:17.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm already blind
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.13,0:34:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, let's check
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.96,0:35:04.80,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that I really found what I needed
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.40,0:35:25.86,general text,,0,0,0,,So be it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.94,0:35:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,From now on, you are Jin Bu Young, the lost daughter of Jinyoung
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.07,0:35:32.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.29,0:35:35.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.30,0:35:49.30,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook stopped training again
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.76,0:35:57.27,voiceover,,0,0,0,,How should I punish him this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.56,0:36:04.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to me, you work hard
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.20,0:36:10.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.70,0:36:13.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I will have to sweep the yard again
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.38,0:36:22.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you arguing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.67,0:36:24.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will help you leave
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.92,0:36:26.25,general text,,0,0,0,,You cheated
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.80,0:36:28.92,general text,,0,0,0,,If I talk about this, you will be thrown out of here right away
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.22,0:36:32.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.89,0:36:36.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I am grateful for the leaves that fell with your help
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.06,0:36:39.60,general text,,0,0,0,,You can continue to shake the tree
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.40,0:36:43.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.02,0:36:46.48,general text,,0,0,0,,for answers, not for leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.53,0:36:53.45,general text,,0,0,0,,So you didn’t come to grumble, but for gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.53,0:36:56.24,general text,,0,0,0,,It takes me a long time to understand, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.33,0:36:58.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I am immensely grateful to you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.04,0:37:02.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course you are grateful. I wrote down the answers myself
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.67,0:37:06.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you even know how to wash ink?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.46,0:37:10.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you written an answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.22,0:37:14.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.09,0:37:16.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I learned that rice paste removes ink
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.22,0:37:20.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Even tried it myself, it works
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.02,0:37:22.39,general text,,0,0,0,,There are simply no words
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.98,0:37:26.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I am forever in your debt
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.69,0:37:28.82,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.74,0:37:31.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Happy to be with your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.65,0:37:34.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard he read “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.36,0:37:35.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.57,0:37:38.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Among the magicians of Jeongjingak, he did it the fastest
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.08,0:37:44.00,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely that it’s just talent and skills
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.58,0:37:46.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably lucky again
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.29,0:37:50.09,general text,,0,0,0,,But he defeated you in a duel
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.30,0:37:56.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I know what Chan Wook is capable of because I fought him
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:38:01.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Poor sword skills, weak spells
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.18,0:38:04.90,general text,,0,0,0,,He was lucky to use Tansu. It's not about skills
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.19,0:38:08.23,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,He's right about something
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.98,0:38:12.61,general text,,0,0,0,,So he came to Jeonjingak. Become a powerful magician
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.69,0:38:15.82,general text,,0,0,0,,In fact, he lacked the skills to even join Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.49,0:38:19.91,general text,,0,0,0,,If he defeats anyone here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.66,0:38:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I recognize it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.58,0:38:26.63,voiceover,,0,0,0,,It would be nice to use the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.71,0:38:27.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.34,0:38:31.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Or maybe we can argue?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.55,0:38:33.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Shall we bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.05,0:38:37.18,general text,,0,0,0,,What will I get from arguing with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.39,0:38:42.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I will give you the most precious thing I have
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.48,0:38:51.86,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first to choose
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.94,0:38:53.82,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll take red, you take blue
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.03,0:39:01.83,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Wait. I'll come there
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.49,0:39:03.87,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I missed you too
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.33,0:39:06.67,memories,,0,0,0,,This is my answer
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.76,0:39:18.39,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mister\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.01,0:39:21.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I bought your favorite cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.93,0:39:23.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you staying for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.47,0:39:25.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I returned home for a couple of days
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.43,0:39:29.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is this possible?\N- The head gave permission
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.73,0:39:31.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Made me an exception in everything
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.07,0:39:33.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.44,0:39:36.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You read “Words of the Heart” in a couple of days
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.28,0:39:39.45,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s stupid to force you to follow the same rules as ordinary magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.49,0:39:42.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you happy with my success?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.99,0:39:44.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not just happy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.91,0:39:47.21,general text,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how proud I am
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.04,0:39:50.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.54,0:39:54.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I constantly disappointed you, and now you can be proud
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.25,0:39:57.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Should I buy you a beautiful dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.17,0:39:58.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You look
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.68,0:40:02.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need anything. I feel like I have everything
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.97,0:40:05.43,general text,,0,0,0,,People came
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.52,0:40:08.94,general text,,0,0,0,,and they told me that you are your father’s son
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.77,0:40:11.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.36,0:40:14.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Your father was called a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.73,0:40:18.24,general text,,0,0,0,,And now they say that you are as talented as your father
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.24,0:40:22.62,general text,,0,0,0,,People said that I don’t look like him at all
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.99,0:40:27.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You will make progress,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.29,0:40:31.96,general text,,0,0,0,,and people won’t say anything like that about you anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.04,0:40:35.21,general text,,0,0,0,,What if there is no success? Will they start spreading rumors again?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.09,0:40:38.21,general text,,0,0,0,,No, it’s not like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.55,0:40:42.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell them they are free to say whatever they want
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.72,0:40:44.01,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t bother me anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.06,0:40:47.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. You can't worry about this anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:54.90,general text,,0,0,0,,And besides, your successes are your merits
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.98,0:40:56.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Which side is the father here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.07,0:40:59.44,general text,,0,0,0,,He was never around
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.03,0:41:03.70,general text,,0,0,0,,And in general, all because I
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.78,0:41:05.16,general text,,0,0,0,,raised you well
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.96,0:41:15.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You will always be my dear sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.92,0:41:18.55,general text,,0,0,0,,with or without success
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.01,0:41:21.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.55,0:41:26.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you can go home and be lazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.81,0:41:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you want it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.56,0:41:33.02,general text,,0,0,0,,But I thought you hated it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.56,0:41:38.23,general text,,0,0,0,,If you compare when you returned from Danhyangok,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.32,0:41:41.53,general text,,0,0,0,,looked much happier than when they just
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.53,0:41:44.16,general text,,0,0,0,,chilling at home
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.49,0:41:48.41,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't stop you, despite all the danger
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.04,0:41:50.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.62,0:41:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,so that you succeed in whatever you choose for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.04,0:41:59.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.17,0:42:04.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I must go back
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.59,0:42:07.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.35,0:42:10.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. If you asked me to leave, I would do the opposite
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.97,0:42:13.06,general text,,0,0,0,,But after such a speech, we need to go back
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.14,0:42:16.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I must do everything possible to make you proud
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.23,0:42:20.53,general text,,0,0,0,,And the head? Doesn't it hurt anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.23,0:42:22.36,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.24,0:42:25.24,general text,,0,0,0,,What people, what horses
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.32,0:42:27.57,general text,,0,0,0,,teach with carrots and sticks
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.78,0:42:31.87,general text,,0,0,0,,They just whipped me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.45,0:42:35.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Who dared to hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.42,0:42:37.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I won’t just stand there while they beat me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.84,0:42:41.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Wrap me some sweets
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.42,0:42:42.84,general text,,0,0,0,,A bunch of cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.80,0:42:46.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- It will be fun\N- Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.59,0:42:48.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.97,0:42:51.10,general text,,0,0,0,,You're finally here
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.81,0:42:52.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.02,0:42:55.81,general text,,0,0,0,,It feels like you were all waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.44,0:42:58.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Does everyone want the cookies I brought?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.98,0:43:02.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Go to the training room. It will be fun
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.54,0:43:15.62,general text,,0,0,0,,- Were you waiting for me?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.71,0:43:18.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be your first opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.96,0:43:20.79,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.54,0:43:23.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's start the fight
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.09,0:43:26.13,general text,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, you lose
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.01,0:43:28.47,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.47,0:43:34.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Take
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.63,0:44:04.71,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook lost
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.51,0:44:09.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Gyo Ho, the winner, can take his golden toad
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.29,0:44:38.66,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.75,0:44:40.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I bet
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.08,0:44:42.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t argue with you about anything, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.46,0:44:45.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Not with you, with your maid
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.30,0:44:52.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I told her that you can’t defeat a single magician here
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.59,0:44:53.97,general text,,0,0,0,,you can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.05,0:44:57.06,general text,,0,0,0,,And your maid said that you will defeat at least one
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.97,0:44:59.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.77,0:45:04.11,general text,,0,0,0,,You will fight every day for ten days
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.19,0:45:06.02,general text,,0,0,0,,If you never win,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.11,0:45:08.57,general text,,0,0,0,,she will give me the most precious thing she has
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.28,0:45:11.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.53,0:45:14.24,general text,,0,0,0,,What is so precious to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.87,0:45:16.62,general text,,0,0,0,,What you gave me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.70,0:45:20.16,general text,,0,0,0,,It's at stake
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.67,0:45:32.30,general text,,0,0,0,,This jade looks expensive, I want it for myself
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.51,0:45:36.30,general text,,0,0,0,,So I brought the golden toads
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.39,0:45:37.97,general text,,0,0,0,,as a prize
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.65,0:45:48.44,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don't win before the toads end,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.52,0:45:49.94,general text,,0,0,0,,this will be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.57,0:45:52.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I am of little interest to such a dispute
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.66,0:45:56.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I wasn’t arguing with you, but with her
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.16,0:45:59.49,general text,,0,0,0,,If you give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.58,0:46:02.08,general text,,0,0,0,,which means she didn’t win a single fight, which means she lost
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.96,0:46:04.08,general text,,0,0,0,,And this will be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.80,0:46:09.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.17,0:46:13.84,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the most valuable thing I have received
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.80,0:46:19.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Please take him back
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.44,0:46:31.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Watch more
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.11,0:46:33.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You really got a golden toad
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.82,0:46:37.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Let Uk read “Words of the Heart”,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.45,0:46:39.78,general text,,0,0,0,,- but he doesn’t wield a sword well\N- What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.70,0:46:44.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Prince and Moo Deok argued
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.54,0:46:48.84,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince brought golden toads, so everyone wants to participate
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.25,0:46:53.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Strong magicians line up
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.17,0:46:56.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Put
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.23,0:47:06.73,general text,,0,0,0,,His Highness laughed at you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.27,0:47:09.27,general text,,0,0,0,,As your teacher, I could not remain silent
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.36,0:47:12.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t lie. I know you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.53,0:47:15.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I've been lazy these couple of days,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.32,0:47:17.70,general text,,0,0,0,,so you made a bet for me to train
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.20,0:47:21.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.66,0:47:26.96,general text,,0,0,0,,You will have to fight with a dozen magicians, whether you like it or not
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.46,0:47:31.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The first fight was even more of a disappointment
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.25,0:47:34.34,general text,,0,0,0,,The step is heavy, you move the sword slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.42,0:47:37.68,general text,,0,0,0,,- Tomorrow is a duel with...\N- I refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.97,0:47:43.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if you lose, you will remember what you saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.35,0:47:44.56,general text,,0,0,0,,this will help you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.64,0:47:47.64,general text,,0,0,0,,- I will not fight\N- Ten fights -
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.73,0:47:50.23,general text,,0,0,0,,ten different styles
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.06,0:47:52.57,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mu Dok...\N- Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.65,0:47:54.82,general text,,0,0,0,,you can safely go home to soak
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.90,0:47:57.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you will never return that jade
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.78,0:47:59.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.95,0:48:02.53,general text,,0,0,0,,You bet
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.12,0:48:04.12,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.29,0:48:07.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you put my gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.71,0:48:08.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.33,0:48:12.79,general text,,0,0,0,,This was the only way to make you fight and win
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.55,0:48:16.71,general text,,0,0,0,,When I said that I missed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.80,0:48:19.34,general text,,0,0,0,,is this what you meant by my weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.18,0:48:23.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.68,0:48:26.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You probably hate me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.68,0:48:30.52,general text,,0,0,0,,but you can’t lose what belongs to both of us
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.32,0:48:37.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that why you said I was poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.69,0:48:39.99,general text,,0,0,0,,If you return him, I will smile broadly at you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.91,0:48:42.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Instead of an antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.79,0:48:47.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.25,0:48:50.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Return it in any way
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.83,0:48:54.21,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the most valuable thing I've ever owned
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.67,0:48:57.30,general text,,0,0,0,,received in my entire life
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.01,0:49:01.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he really dear to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.43,0:49:03.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.14,0:49:06.64,general text,,0,0,0,,is it just very expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.19,0:49:14.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I will take it from the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.15,0:49:17.19,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s strange to have something in common with him
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.24,0:49:26.49,general text,,0,0,0,,But it wasn’t worth sharing with you either
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.35,0:49:50.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you visit Saejukwon often
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.60,0:49:54.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you want to appoint Master Huo as your teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.40,0:49:57.65,general text,,0,0,0,,and learn magic from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.94,0:50:00.15,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.90,0:50:02.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You are my teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.82,0:50:05.57,italics,,0,0,0,,I only go there for treatment
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.66,0:50:09.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Breathing fresh air. Plus, funny things often happen there
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.37,0:50:13.04,general text,,0,0,0,,You must enjoy spending time with the magicians of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.12,0:50:15.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I am talking with Yul, my cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.37,0:50:17.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Park Dan Gu is also fun
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.63,0:50:20.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah Chang Wook... I would like to teach him a lesson, but it's not that easy
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.42,0:50:23.97,general text,,0,0,0,,He seems delighted that he read “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.05,0:50:26.01,general text,,0,0,0,,so today I put it in its place
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.09,0:50:28.60,italics,,0,0,0,,He lost to a magician who had just mastered Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.68,0:50:30.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Now people know his true power
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.89,0:50:32.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Nobody admires him anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.61,0:50:40.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Beautiful jade
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.65,0:50:43.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I exchanged it for ten golden toads
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.82,0:50:47.62,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is he so valuable?\N- He has Yin energy
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.32,0:50:50.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the second half?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.33,0:50:51.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Second half?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.45,0:50:53.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Objects with opposite energy always have a pair
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.96,0:50:56.21,italics,,0,0,0,,There must also be red jade
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.96,0:50:59.09,general text,,0,0,0,,They have value only in pairs
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.84,0:51:05.59,italics,,0,0,0,,So he has a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.09,0:51:07.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch O
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.05,0:51:10.60,general text,,0,0,0,,If people have paired things, what could that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.68,0:51:12.77,general text,,0,0,0,,This means that they are married or dating
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.23,0:51:16.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Holy shit
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.31,0:51:20.36,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t like this jade, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.44,0:51:23.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, he infuriates me. Gets on my nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.36,0:51:27.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Take it and break it into small pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.36,0:51:29.99,italics,,0,0,0,,You can't do that
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.07,0:51:31.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook can win it back
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:36.00,general text,,0,0,0,,If he returns it,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.87,0:51:38.29,general text,,0,0,0,,then they will become a couple again
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.71,0:51:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.18,0:51:54.35,italics,,0,0,0,,- Master Li\N{\i0}- Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.48,0:51:59.94,general text,,0,0,0,,What brought you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.27,0:52:04.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I wore hemp clothes all year and never felt cold
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.82,0:52:06.65,italics,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.65,0:52:09.36,general text,,0,0,0,,it was worth wearing this scarf,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.24,0:52:12.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I realized how cold I was
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.91,0:52:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,What is that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.12,0:52:20.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.00,0:52:28.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Never in my life have flowers seemed beautiful to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.09,0:52:33.89,general text,,0,0,0,,but as soon as I saw these, I wanted to give them to you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.15,0:52:42.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.69,0:52:46.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.66,0:52:55.99,general text,,0,0,0,,These books...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.08,0:52:57.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You have good books here
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.62,0:53:00.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent book
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.42,0:53:08.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.01,0:53:11.18,general text,,0,0,0,,sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.26,0:53:13.30,general text,,0,0,0,,She hasn’t appeared in Sosnovy Bor for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.39,0:53:14.93,general text,,0,0,0,,She went there yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.55,0:53:17.64,italics,,0,0,0,,She visits Mr. Chan often
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.72,0:53:19.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Here's how
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.02,0:53:24.48,general text,,0,0,0,,She just didn’t come to see me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.52,0:53:28.78,general text,,0,0,0,,She has a guest now
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.86,0:53:30.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Guest? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.74,0:53:34.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know him, but he’s a young man
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.95,0:53:36.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.37,0:53:41.04,general text,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, maid Kim does not know any young men
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.97,0:53:52.59,italics,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.18,0:53:59.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.35,0:54:03.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of weeds are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.14,0:54:04.94,general text,,0,0,0,,These are flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.81,0:54:08.02,general text,,0,0,0,,- What other weeds?{\i1}\N- Maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.52,0:54:12.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you offended because I was rude that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.90,0:54:14.41,general text,,0,0,0,,So they stopped coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.45,0:54:18.95,italics,,0,0,0,,I really didn’t know. Thought you were sick
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.03,0:54:21.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I was worried and came here
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.16,0:54:22.87,general text,,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t have come
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.50,0:54:25.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You said you would never come here
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.67,0:54:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,When did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.75,0:54:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,You are wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.59,0:54:32.17,italics,,0,0,0,,But still
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.26,0:54:34.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.43,0:54:42.60,general text,,0,0,0,,If they were so worried about my health,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.77,0:54:46.73,general text,,0,0,0,,at least they could bring weeds
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.81,0:54:48.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you need weeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.23,0:54:50.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll bring them
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.11,0:54:53.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need them
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.90,0:54:57.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not asking you for weeds, but for flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.03,0:55:01.62,italics,,0,0,0,,I want you to show
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.70,0:55:03.29,general text,,0,0,0,,your concern,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.37,0:55:06.17,general text,,0,0,0,,giving me something beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.96,0:55:16.05,general text,,0,0,0,,My guest is still here, you better leave
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.22,0:55:18.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.30,0:55:20.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.81,0:55:25.39,general text,,0,0,0,,When you come to visit Uka,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.19,0:55:29.73,general text,,0,0,0,,hope you'll come see me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.53,0:55:34.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.24,0:55:39.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Drives me because,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.16,0:55:43.20,general text,,0,0,0,,that I came empty-handed?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.87,0:55:46.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.33,0:55:49.75,general text,,0,0,0,,How cold-blooded
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.61,0:56:17.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Since his shoes are smaller than mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.90,0:56:20.78,general text,,0,0,0,,that means he is shorter
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.63,0:56:37.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you like sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.01,0:56:38.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.22,0:56:46.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Tasty
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.64,0:56:49.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Then take it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.40,0:56:52.52,general text,,0,0,0,,This is for me
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.95,0:57:09.00,general text,,0,0,0,,- How do I look?\N- Very beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.08,0:57:10.75,general text,,0,0,0,,- Try it on\N- Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.83,0:57:11.75,general text,,0,0,0,,So how?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.83,0:57:13.71,general text,,0,0,0,,They hang him here
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.76,0:57:30.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Look, flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.23,0:57:33.27,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you should buy flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.35,0:57:36.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to decorate Boo Young unnie's room with them
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.07,0:57:41.86,general text,,0,0,0,,This time, apparently, they found her
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.20,0:57:52.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Really? Did Jin Mu find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.54,0:57:55.08,general text,,0,0,0,,It's still a secret
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.25,0:57:59.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope unnie comes back
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.51,0:58:03.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you will not become Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.34,0:58:06.55,general text,,0,0,0,,But I can marry the one I want
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.68,0:58:10.93,general text,,0,0,0,,You can marry your loved one
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.44,0:58:14.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.73,0:58:19.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we need to break off our fake engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.36,0:58:22.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for pretending to be my fiancé
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.41,0:58:26.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I wasn’t pretending
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.66,0:58:29.79,italics,,0,0,0,,My feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.29,0:58:32.75,general text,,0,0,0,,sincere
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.42,0:58:37.84,italics,,0,0,0,,You will become the head soon
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.92,0:58:41.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Would you marry me? Would you join our family and leave everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.97,0:58:46.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I think I was worrying for nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.76,0:58:49.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I was even preparing for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.97,0:58:51.43,general text,,0,0,0,,that I will be kicked out of the family
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.14,0:58:54.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.31,0:58:58.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Wanted to give up the status of head of Sosnovy Bor for my sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.06,0:59:01.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you don’t want a marriage without love
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.74,0:59:04.61,italics,,0,0,0,,Then I thought, if we get married,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.70,0:59:06.82,general text,,0,0,0,,you will have a loving husband
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.37,0:59:10.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.74,0:59:15.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, you have yet to meet the one you love
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.36,0:59:44.23,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems I’m already
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.94,0:59:47.15,general text,,0,0,0,,met him
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.70,0:59:55.95,general text,,0,0,0,,If you hold on to me like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.75,1:00:02.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I will never let go
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.63,1:00:05.42,italics,,0,0,0,,My feelings are too strong
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.72,1:00:08.63,general text,,0,0,0,,No turning back
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.35,1:00:21.61,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to buy flowers to propose properly
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.44,1:00:26.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.91,1:00:37.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Send these flowers to the Chan family
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.66,1:00:40.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Did someone die?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.83,1:00:42.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you sending them chrysanthemums?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.59,1:00:48.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I almost made a big mistake
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.76,1:00:49.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.01,1:00:52.26,general text,,0,0,0,,From here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.39,1:00:54.89,general text,,0,0,0,,to here
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.97,1:00:56.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Send everything
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.56,1:00:59.14,general text,,0,0,0,,- All these flowers?\N- Yes, all
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.23,1:01:01.90,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’m sure she’ll like at least something{\i1}\N- It can’t be
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.98,1:01:04.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.90,1:01:09.19,general text,,0,0,0,,- Which ones do you like?\N- These are these
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.90,1:01:12.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I can buy everything if you want
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.64,1:01:38.68,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the future head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.85,1:01:42.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you meeting with the future head of Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.73,1:01:43.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.48,1:01:47.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to give up your inheritance and join their family?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.61,1:01:51.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle, we love each other
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.86,1:01:53.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Not long ago Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.82,1:01:56.28,general text,,0,0,0,,loved Uka
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.91,1:01:58.95,general text,,0,0,0,,No. Today she proved it to me
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.04,1:02:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young said that she will give up the title of head for the sake of love
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.08,1:02:04.58,general text,,0,0,0,,They only have one daughter
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.67,1:02:06.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Who will become the head of Jinyowon then?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.79,1:02:09.25,general text,,0,0,0,,She will become the eldest daughter
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.34,1:02:12.80,general text,,0,0,0,,The magicians of Jeonbugwan help them find her missing sister
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.22,1:02:15.14,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.22,1:02:17.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Deputy Jin Mu comes to see them every day
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.64,1:02:20.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.60,1:02:24.56,general text,,0,0,0,,If only I had a brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.65,1:02:27.44,general text,,0,0,0,,which will become the head instead of me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.86,1:02:31.32,italics,,0,0,0,,I’m asking purely out of curiosity
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.11,1:02:35.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle, are you sure you don’t have a child on your side?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.91,1:02:40.83,general text,,0,0,0,,None?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.45,1:02:43.62,general text,,0,0,0,,At all?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.17,1:02:47.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.75,1:02:50.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.17,1:02:51.30,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.38,1:02:52.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.63,1:02:57.26,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not too late, you can have a child now
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.34,1:02:58.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.39,1:03:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I mean, you’re still full of strength
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.14,1:03:04.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Catch this scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.65,1:03:09.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, well
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.83,1:03:23.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many colors here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.83,1:03:27.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I had a fight with one person. So he's trying to make peace
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.71,1:03:32.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you forgive him. These flowers are beautiful
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.67,1:03:36.55,general text,,0,0,0,,You are so kind
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.68,1:03:39.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Young Master Chan's mother...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.30,1:03:42.76,general text,,0,0,0,,was as kind as you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.77,1:03:45.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Uk went into it
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.31,1:03:48.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.69,1:03:53.07,general text,,0,0,0,,What made you think that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.36,1:03:57.36,general text,,0,0,0,,When he talked about his mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.45,1:03:59.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I felt warmth
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.24,1:04:01.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw it in his eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.83,1:04:03.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.41,1:04:07.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he talk to you about his mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.71,1:04:10.54,general text,,0,0,0,,You must be very close to him
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.75,1:04:13.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.71,1:04:15.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Only Young Master Chan wants to get closer
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.80,1:04:19.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Last time he spent as much as 4 hours with the lady
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.30,1:04:21.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.43,1:04:24.22,general text,,0,0,0,,We just talked a little
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.68,1:04:29.44,general text,,0,0,0,,It turns out it’s you. white heron
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.69,1:04:33.77,general text,,0,0,0,,The gentleman may be cold, he has suffered in the past
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.86,1:04:37.57,general text,,0,0,0,,And how to open up to someone - kind and caring
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.53,1:04:41.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Visit us more often
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.53,1:04:43.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Consider this place your nest
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.87,1:04:46.29,general text,,0,0,0,,and come here often
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.50,1:04:48.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.38,1:04:58.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu helps Jin Ho Kyung find his daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.97,1:05:01.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I think this is just an excuse
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.30,1:05:03.14,general text,,0,0,0,,visit Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.93,1:05:07.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I think Jin Mu wants to enlist the support of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.10,1:05:11.65,general text,,0,0,0,,If he succeeds,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.44,1:05:15.19,general text,,0,0,0,,he can resist Pine Forest
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.27,1:05:16.27,general text,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.28,1:05:20.65,general text,,0,0,0,,he and his people without fear and regrets
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.66,1:05:26.20,general text,,0,0,0,,will reveal the power of the ice stone to the world
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.04,1:05:38.26,italics,,0,0,0,,One of Jin Mu’s people has the stone
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.01,1:05:43.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks the stone is made of ice,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.76,1:05:48.39,italics,,0,0,0,,but the forces of fire, water and wind are concentrated in it
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.31,1:05:51.52,italics,,0,0,0,,200 years ago, a magician from the Choi family created a reflector
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.23,1:05:56.40,italics,,0,0,0,,And now someone is using the power of the stone to repeat this
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.78,1:06:11.50,italics,,0,0,0,,New batch of reflectors made by the queen
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.67,1:06:19.42,italics,,0,0,0,,Evil does not lie in the power of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.50,1:06:23.63,italics,,0,0,0,,The reflector is what is used for evil purposes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.93,1:06:30.10,italics,,0,0,0,,A force that is beyond the control of an ordinary person,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.18,1:06:32.43,italics,,0,0,0,,will want to have everything if it becomes available
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.64,1:06:36.19,italics,,0,0,0,,The power to leave the old body
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.27,1:06:38.02,italics,,0,0,0,,and take a new one
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.77,1:06:44.07,italics,,0,0,0,,An old body in exchange for a young one, an ugly one for a beautiful one
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.36,1:06:49.03,italics,,0,0,0,,The power to stop death and make life eternal
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.72,1:07:07.89,general text,,0,0,0,,He is a young, healthy and wonderful young man
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.47,1:07:09.47,general text,,0,0,0,,It was selected...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.39,1:07:13.64,general text,,0,0,0,,by my successor
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.43,1:07:16.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to migrate into his body
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.85,1:07:19.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.27,1:07:22.65,general text,,0,0,0,,What spell did you want to show me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.24,1:07:24.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.15,1:07:26.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of souls?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.07,1:07:32.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I still have so many things to do,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.45,1:07:37.21,general text,,0,0,0,,but this body is no good, the disease is bringing his imminent death closer
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.46,1:07:39.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.96,1:07:43.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I need your body
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.55,1:07:48.72,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.99,1:08:09.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.21,1:08:19.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, I don’t want to switch bodies
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.83,1:08:22.25,general text,,0,0,0,,If I switch bodies with you, I will soon die
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.34,1:08:24.30,general text,,0,0,0,,But your body will live
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.39,1:08:36.52,italics,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.14,1:08:38.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Save me
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.23,1:08:42.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Help me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.61,1:08:46.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.84,1:10:35.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.01,1:10:37.01,general text,,0,0,0,,My body...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.10,1:10:38.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Return everything back
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.51,1:10:41.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Please. I don't want to die
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.81,1:10:44.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Master! Give me my body
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.39,1:10:47.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Master! I want to return to my body
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.19,1:10:49.11,italics,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.57,1:10:54.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of souls helped save the life of another
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.70,1:10:56.91,general text,,0,0,0,,valuable magician
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.71,1:11:07.92,general text,,0,0,0,,While we
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.92,1:11:10.67,general text,,0,0,0,,we have the power of the stone,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.75,1:11:14.30,general text,,0,0,0,,our souls will be able to live forever, and not rot in these bodies
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.34,1:11:18.47,italics,,0,0,0,,Now the power of the stone is prohibited,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.55,1:11:21.97,general text,,0,0,0,,so you have to do alchemy secretly
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.06,1:11:26.27,general text,,0,0,0,,But sooner or later the day will come when our strength will strengthen
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.35,1:11:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,We will show everyone that we are right. Our hard work will pay off
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.15,1:11:32.40,general text,,0,0,0,,And on this day
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.53,1:11:35.11,general text,,0,0,0,,everyone present here...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.65,1:11:39.03,general text,,0,0,0,,will defeat death and gain eternal life
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.35,1:12:03.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you see everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.89,1:12:07.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.06,1:12:12.48,general text,,0,0,0,,You must bring one person here
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.98,1:12:17.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Ho Kyung will become your mother. Get closer to her
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.90,1:12:20.74,general text,,0,0,0,,And then bring her here
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.62,1:12:24.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you handle it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.79,1:12:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.88,1:12:40.30,italics,,0,0,0,,She fits
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.34,1:12:43.72,italics,,0,0,0,,If you can bring Jin Ho Kyung here,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.01,1:12:49.02,general text,,0,0,0,,it will be easier to reveal the power of the stone to the whole world
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.65,1:13:42.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Why aren’t you sleeping yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.50,1:13:55.46,italics,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu can become
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.54,1:13:59.71,general text,,0,0,0,,stronger and more influential than we think
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.97,1:14:05.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Surely the King’s star appeared in order to eliminate the chaos caused by the stone
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.47,1:14:10.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Uke?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.18,1:14:13.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung, who prevented the horror of two hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.02,1:14:16.23,general text,,0,0,0,,also born under a similar star
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.31,1:14:18.11,general text,,0,0,0,,This star was created by magic
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.19,1:14:20.07,general text,,0,0,0,,She cannot be compared with the star of Master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.36,1:14:24.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Did I mention that the star is the same?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.03,1:14:27.70,general text,,0,0,0,,So I'm curious
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.79,1:14:34.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this star will slowly go out
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.29,1:14:37.88,general text,,0,0,0,,or will it shine brightly?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.08,1:15:17.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.21,1:15:19.67,italics,,0,0,0,,- Excellent\N- Good job
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.75,1:15:20.84,italics,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.76,1:16:05.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I knew about Tansu
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.13,1:16:08.22,italics,,0,0,0,,The prince didn’t know, so you did it
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.30,1:16:11.22,general text,,0,0,0,,And also water from the puddle that everyone saw
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.30,1:16:12.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Easy as pie
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.69,1:16:27.95,italics,,0,0,0,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.78,1:16:32.62,italics,,0,0,0,,- Excellent!\N- Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.05,1:16:54.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Only three toads left?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.35,1:16:55.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.56,1:16:59.69,general text,,0,0,0,,So he's been fighting for the last seven days in a row?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.77,1:17:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,And constantly lost
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.36,1:17:06.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought he would stop if he kept losing
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.07,1:17:11.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he’s trying for this
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.16,1:17:14.70,general text,,0,0,0,,As you said, he doesn’t wield a sword well, his spells are weak
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.78,1:17:16.20,general text,,0,0,0,,But he continues to fight...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.29,1:17:18.83,general text,,0,0,0,,only because he’s persistent
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.33,1:17:22.96,general text,,0,0,0,,These are just duels, but he fights with other magicians every day
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.04,1:17:24.59,italics,,0,0,0,,He's definitely exhausted
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.67,1:17:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I believe in your victory
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.76,1:17:30.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Even I didn’t have a chance to fight the magicians of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.80,1:17:33.26,general text,,0,0,0,,But I let Chan Wook do it...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.34,1:17:35.60,general text,,0,0,0,,for your own golden frogs
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.68,1:17:37.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Mu Deok fooled me again?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.87,1:18:00.79,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Fight and lose, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.30,1:18:18.22,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Everything that doesn’t kill you,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.19,1:18:26.15,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,only makes you stronger
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.56,1:19:01.77,preview,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook!\N- Have you come to the owner?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.85,1:19:04.10,preview,,0,0,0,,Let him lose, he becomes stronger
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.69,1:19:06.52,preview,,0,0,0,,Don’t go
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.60,1:19:08.40,preview,,0,0,0,,Don’t go to your room, stay here
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.48,1:19:11.07,preview,,0,0,0,,What a horror! Look at the shoes. All wet
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.15,1:19:12.40,preview,,0,0,0,,You're wounded
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.99,1:19:17.49,preview,,0,0,0,,There is commotion in the capital. Last night he was attacked by several assassins
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.57,1:19:20.83,preview,,0,0,0,,- Don’t kill him!\N- Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.79,1:19:23.87,preview,,0,0,0,,- He’s a nomad\N- Come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.96,1:19:25.58,preview,,0,0,0,,- I'm coming\N- Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.67,1:19:29.96,preview,,0,0,0,,I don’t think it’s right to let go of a magician who just got here so easily
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.04,1:19:32.13,preview,,0,0,0,,Once you go wild, you can’t go back
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.21,1:19:34.22,preview,,0,0,0,,You cannot become a man, only a monster
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.30,1:19:36.88,preview,,0,0,0,,We can protect the monsters of this world
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.60,1:19:44.60,preview,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.60,1:19:46.60,general text,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.79,0:48:14.79,general text,,0,0,0,,

